[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_5ace0")
action_name = "Generate User Stories"
action_prompt = "Based on whatever context the user provides and the code selected:

´´´gdscript
{CODE}
´´´
Write a full user story as a comment on the code. It will be used by subsequent models to understand the requirements to write the code in gdscript. Don't forget the structure:

1. As a (stakeholder)
2. I'd like to (do something. describe what the stakeholder would like to achieve)
3. So that (the reasons or end goal. Write what the stakeholder would like to achieve as a consequence of this story).

Next, write the context of the task, a description of what needs to be done, and a list of requirements in order for it to be done properly and high quality.

Finally, let's add acceptance criteria. These are essentially test cases. So when each are satisfied, we can say that the feature has been really finished. Structured in this way:

Given: (write the context of the system)
When: (something happens or a specific trigger)
Then: (the effect or follow up action)

Make sure you append this user story ticket as a comment next to the most appropriate part of the code."
icon = SubResource("AtlasTexture_ymeku")
response_target = 1
code_placement = 1
format_response_as_comment = true
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://d0fa2nefrqetl"
